{"ancestors": "0,9028541,9028551", "bizKey": "9031927", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2024-09-06 16:43:07", "detail": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>题材介绍</strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">电容式按键，作为一种全新的交互方式，其工作原理是通过感应人体静电来实现按键功能。与传统的机械按键相比，电容式按键具有更高的灵敏度和更长的使用寿命。在iPhone 16上，</span><a href=\"https://xueqiu.com/S/AAPL?from=status_stock_match\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-indent: 36.8px; text-align: start;\">苹果公司</a><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">将这一技术应用于手机按键设计，彻底摒弃了实体按键，为用户带来了全新的操作体验。</span></p>", "firstLetter": "DRSAJ", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "电容式按键", "parentId": 9028551, "pctChg": -1.04, "reason": "电容式按键", "remark": "", "sort": 1, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9031927, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2024-09-06 16:43:07"}
